      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Robert Orben''' (born [[March 4]], [[1927]]) is an [[United States|American]] [[Magic (illusion)|magic]]ian and professional [[comedy]] writer. He is also an [[author]] of [[book]]s for magicians. He wrote a book called &quot;Speaker's Handbook of Humor&quot;.

He was a speech writer for Presidents [[Richard Nixon]] and [[Gerald Ford]].

