      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Image:PS-missionaire-1.jpg|thumb|]]
The '''coital alignment technique''' [[List of sex positions|sex position]] is a variant of the [[missionary position]].  The man lies above the woman as in the [[missionary position]], but moves upward along her body, so that the base of his penis provides stimulation to her [[clitoris]] as they both thrust.  (The woman may wrap her legs around his.)  It is asserted to be very good at stimulating the woman and is intended to increase her likelihood of having an [[orgasm]].

