      <text xml:space="preserve">{{wiktionarypar|slate}}
'''Slate''' may refer to:
*[[Slate]], a type of rock
*[[Slate (writing)]], a sheet of material, originally made of slate, on which a person can write
*[[Slate gray]], a color
*[[Slate (magazine)]], an internet-based culture magazine owned by ''The Washington Post''
*[[Slate programming language]], a prototype-based programming language
*''[[Slates (album)]]'', a 1981 album by the rock band The Fall
*[[Slate (band)]], a rock band from southern Florida
*Nate Slate, a fictional character in [[The Flintstones]]
*A list of affiliated candidates for an election or a political party

