      <comment>rm red see also</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">Precedence is a simple ordering, based on either importance or sequence; it may refer to one of the following:

* [[Message precedence]] of military communications traffic
* [[Order of precedence]], the ceremonial hierarchy within a nation or state
* [[Order of operations]] in mathematics
* [[Precedence Entertainment]], a deceased publisher of several [[collectible card game|collectible card games]].
