[[Category:German physicists|Schön, Jan Hendrik]]
[[Category:Fraudsters|Schön, Jan Hendrik]]
[[Category:Scientific misconduct|Schön, Jan Hendrik]]

[[da:Jan Hendrik Schön]]
[[de:Jan Hendrik Schön]]
[[ko:얀 헨드릭 쇤]]
[[sv:Jan Hendrik Schön]]</text>
