      <text xml:space="preserve">{{Infobox_river | river_name = Peene
  | image_name = 
  | caption = 
  | origin = [[Mecklenburg]]
  | mouth = [[Baltic Sea]]
  | basin_countries = [[Germany]]
  | length = ±175 km
  | elevation = 28 m
  | discharge = 
  | watershed = 
