  <page>
    <title>Robozilla</title>
    <id>275670</id>
    <revision>
      <id>21499767</id>
      <timestamp>2005-08-21T14:26:21Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <ip>212.160.70.45</ip>
      </contributor>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Robozilla''', or Rob O'Zilla, is a web robot that checks through the links listed in the [[Open Directory Project]] to verify that they are working. If Robozilla finds any bad links he flags them and lets the editors fix the links. Thanks to Robozilla the amount of [[link rot]] at ODP is kept below one percent.

== External links ==
* http://www.robotstxt.org/wc/active/html/robozilla.html
* http://www.dmoz.org/newsletter/2000Aug/robo.html - &quot;When Robozilla Roaars!&quot;, ODP newsletter 2000
* http://dmoz.yklaw.net/DDP/Interface_and_Features/Robozilla/ - information from DMOZ Documentation Project

[[de:Robozilla]]
[[pl:Robozilla]]</text>
    </revision>
  </page>
