      <comment>Reverted edits by [[Special:Contributions/200.103.163.235|200.103.163.235]] ([[User talk:200.103.163.235|talk]]) to last version by Caerwine</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">The '''Treaty of Paris of 1810''', signed on [[January 6]], [[1810]], ended the [[First War against Napoleon|war]] between [[France]] and [[Sweden]].

