  <page>
    <title>Harry Ramsden's</title>
    <id>275770</id>
    <revision>
      <id>33140235</id>
      <timestamp>2005-12-29T17:25:12Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Jamesedmo</username>
        <id>386802</id>
      </contributor>
      <comment>Clarified Epcot location</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Harry Ramsden's''' is a worldwide [[restaurants|restaurant]] chain dedicated to traditional British-style [[fish and chips]].

Based in the UK, the business has over 170 owned and [[Franchising|franchise]]d outlets internationally, and serves around 10 million people annually. It has locations in [[Saudi Arabia]] and even at [[Epcot]] in the [[Walt Disney World Resort]], [[Florida]].

The business was started by [[Harry Ramsden]] in [[1928]] in a wooden shed in  [[Guiseley]] near [[Leeds]], in the north of [[England]]. Three years later he moved into a 'fish and chip palace', complete with fitted [[carpet]]s, [[oak]] panelled walls and [[chandelier]]s.

It is now owned by the [[Compass Group]].

== External link ==
*[http://www.harryramsdens.co.uk/ Harry Ramsden's website]

[[Category:Fast-food seafood restaurants]]
[[Category:Catering and food service companies of the United Kingdom]]</text>
    </revision>
