      <text xml:space="preserve">'''CMF''' may stand for:
* [[CMF (therapy)]]: A [[chemotherapy]] regime comprising [[cyclophosphamide]], [[methotrexate]] and [[5-fluoruracil]].
* The [[Australian Citizens Military Forces]] :the name given to reserve units of the [[Australian Army]] between [[1901]] and [[1980]].
