      <text xml:space="preserve">[[Ned Kelly]] the day before execution.  Photo taken in 1880, so public domain.

Image taken by Charles Nettleton, in the State Library of Victoria collection.

Image taken from:

* http://www.statelibrary.vic.gov.au/slv/exhibitions/kellyculture/intro1.html

More information available there..

{{PD}}</text>
