      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Balti''' can refer to:

*[[Balti, Moldova|B&amp;#259;l&amp;#355;i]] - a city and county in [[Moldova | Moldavia]]
*[[Balti dynasty]] - a branch of the ancient [[Visigoth|Visigoths]]
*[[Balti language]] - a language spoken in [[Baltistan]] and Ladakh in [[Jammu &amp; Kashmir]]
*[[Balti (people)|Balti]] - Muslims of Ladakhi/[[Tibetan people|Tibetan]] origin from Baltistan
*[[Balti (food)|Balti]] - a style of food devised in [[Birmingham]] in [[England]]
*[[Balti (pot)|Balti]] - an [[eating utensil]], see  &quot;[[Balti (food)]]&quot;

{{disambig}}

[[mo:Жудецул Бэлць]]
[[ro:Judeţul Bălţi]]</text>
