[[Category:West Point graduates|Howard, Oliver O.]]  
[[Category:American non-fiction writers|Howard, Oliver O.]]  
[[Category:American biographers|Howard Oliver O.]]
[[Category:American historians|Howard, Oliver O.]]  

[[de: Oliver Otis Howard]]</text>
    </revision>
  </page>
