  <page>
    <title>Weymouth (disambiguation)</title>
    <id>275829</id>
    <revision>
      <id>31848277</id>
      <timestamp>2005-12-18T14:26:23Z</timestamp>
      <contributor>
        <username>Staffelde</username>
        <id>385596</id>
      </contributor>
      <minor />
      <comment>add W, Tasmania</comment>
      <text xml:space="preserve">'''Weymouth''' is a place name:

'''United Kingdom'''
*[[Weymouth, Dorset|Weymouth]] is a large coastal town in [[Dorset]], [[England]].

'''Canada'''
*[[Weymouth, Nova Scotia|Weymouth]] is a village in [[Nova Scotia]].

'''United States'''
*[[Weymouth, Massachusetts|Weymouth]] is a town in [[Massachusetts]].
* Weymouth Hall is a collegiate residence hall at [[Texas Tech University]]

'''Australia'''
*[[Weymouth, Tasmania|Weymouth]]

===Other===
'''Weymouth''' is also another name for a [[double bridle]] used on horses for showing and upper level [[dressage]].

{{disambig}}</text>
    </revision>
