*[[Olympia, Washington|Olympia]], [[Washington]]
*[[Santa Barbara, California|Santa Barbara]], California
*[[Scottsdale, Arizona|Scottsdale]], [[Arizona]]
*[[Stanford University]]
*[[Tempe, Arizona|Tempe]], Arizona
*[[Tucson, Arizona|Tucson]], Arizona
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;float:right; width:48%;&quot;&gt;
'''Bronze-level'''[http://www.bicyclefriendlycommunity.org/AllBicycleFriendlyCommunities.htm]

*[[Ada County, Idaho|Ada County]], [[Idaho]]
*[[Albuquerque, New Mexico|Albuquerque]], [[New Mexico]]
