*Code values 00-1F, 7F, 80-9F, DB-DE and FC-FF are &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#CFC&quot;&gt;not assigned to characters&lt;/span&gt; by ISO/IEC 8859-11.
*Code values D1, D4-DA, E7-EE are &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#CCF&quot;&gt;[[combining character]]s&lt;/span&gt;.

