*[http://www.railserve.com/Equipment/Signals/ RailServe.com Signals &amp; Communications] - 100+ links
*[http://www.signalbox.org/ Information on British &quot;Absolute Block&quot; signalling]


[[Category:Rail transport|Signalling]]</text>
